      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Convert $2024_{8}$ to base 10.",
        "zh": "将 $2024_{8}$ 转换为10进制。"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "8",
            "zh": "8"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "532",
            "zh": "532"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "1022",
            "zh": "1022"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "1044",
            "zh": "1044"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "2178",
            "zh": "2178"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "D"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **D**.\n\nUse the place values $8^3,8^2,8,1$ from left to right. The zero still occupies the $8^2$ place. Thus $2024_8=2\\cdot512+0\\cdot64+2\\cdot8+4=1044_{10}$.",
        "zh": "答案：**D**。\n\n从左到右的位权为 $8^3,8^2,8,1$。0 虽然对和没有贡献，仍占据 $8^2$ 位。因此 $2024_8=2\\times512+0\\times64+2\\times8+4=1044_{10}$。"
      },
