      "statement": {
        "en": "Convert $A27_{16}$ to base 8.",
        "zh": "将 $A27_{16}$ 转换为8进制。"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "537",
            "zh": "537"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "547",
            "zh": "547"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "5047",
            "zh": "5047"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "5057",
            "zh": "5057"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "6037",
            "zh": "6037"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **C**.\n\nConvert hexadecimal to binary using four bits per digit, then regroup into three-bit octal digits.\n\n$$A27_{16}=1010\\,0010\\,0111_2=101\\,000\\,100\\,111_2=5047_8.$$\n\nSource correction: the original final base label16 should be8.",
        "zh": "答案：**C**。\n\n把十六进制各位展开成四位二进制：`1010 0010 0111`。从右向左每三位分组：`101 000 100 111`，分别对应 5、0、4、7，得 $5047_8$。原解析末尾误标为十六进制，正确下标是 8。"
      },
