    {
      "id": "q3",
      "number": 3,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "What is the number $198_{10}$ in base 16?",
        "zh": "$198_{10}$ 用16进制表示是什么?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "126",
            "zh": "126"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "6C",
            "zh": "6C"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "B6",
            "zh": "B6"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "C5",
            "zh": "C5"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "C6",
            "zh": "C6"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "E"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **E**.\n\nConverting $198_{10}$ to base 16 is done by repeatedly dividing by the number 16 and getting the remainder. Reading the remainder from last to first always produces the answer:\n\n198/16 = 12 r 6, 12/16 = 0 r 12 so the answer is C6",
        "zh": "答案：**E**。\n\n先除以 16，$198=16\\times12+6$，所以个位是 6。再算 $12=16\\times0+12$，第二个余数 12 在十六进制中写作 C。逆序读余数得 $C6_{16}$。"
      },
      "source": {
