    {
      "id": "q4",
      "number": 4,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "How many 1’s are there in all of the binary numbers from $20_{10}$ to $24_{10}$ inclusive?",
        "zh": "将 $20_{10}$ 到 $24_{10}$（含两端）的所有数转换为二进制后，总共有多少个 1？"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "13",
            "zh": "13"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "14",
            "zh": "14"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "15",
            "zh": "15"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "16",
            "zh": "16"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "17",
            "zh": "17"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **B**.\n\nCounting in binary from $20_{10}$ to $24_{10}$ is:\n\n20 = 10100, 21 = 10101, 22 = 10110, 23 = 10111, 24 = 11000\n\nThere are a total of 14 1’s.",
        "zh": "答案：**B**。\n\n将 20 至 24 写成二进制：`10100、10101、10110、10111、11000`。对应 1 的个数是 2、3、3、4、2。将区间两端也计入，共 14 个。"
      },
