    {
      "id": "q5",
      "number": 5,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Given the two colors $B0E7C3_{16}$ and $98FDAE_{16}$, what is the largest positive difference between the shades of red, green, or blue in hexadecimal?",
        "zh": "给定两种颜色 $B0E7C3_{16}$ 和 $98FDAE_{16}$ ,分别计算这两种颜色的红、绿、蓝色阶之间的差值,并用十六进制表示。请问其中最大正数差是多少?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "16",
            "zh": "16"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "17",
            "zh": "17"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "18",
            "zh": "18"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "19",
            "zh": "19"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "20",
            "zh": "20"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **C**.\n\nThe two colors $B0E7C3_{16}$ and $98FDAE_{16}$ represent the red, green, and blue components of 2 different colors.\n\nThe red difference is B0 - 98 = $18_{16}$ because 16 - 8 = 8 and 10 - 9 = 1. The green difference is FD - E7 = $16_{16}$ because 13 - 7 = 6 and 15 - 14 = 1. The blue difference is C3 - AE = $15_{16}$ because 16 + 3 - 14 = 5 and 11 - 10 = 1.\n\nDifferences determine the varying shade of each component. The largest variation is $18_{16}.$",
        "zh": "答案：**C**。\n\n把颜色分别拆为 `B0 E7 C3` 和 `98 FD AE`，比较每个通道的绝对差。红、绿、蓝的差依次是 $18_{16}$、$16_{16}$、$15_{16}$。三者高位都是 1，比较低位，红色差值 $18_{16}$ 最大。"
      },
