    {
      "id": "q6",
      "number": 6,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "The colors for the Olympic Rings are 0081C8 (water blue), 008651 (shamrock green), 000000 (black), FCB131 (macaroni and cheese), and EE334E (dark carmine pink), how many of the 5 colors do not have a red component?",
        "zh": "奥运五环的颜色包含0081C8(水蓝)、008651(三叶草绿)、000000(黑色)、FCB131(类似芝士通心粉的黄色)、EE334E(深粉红),请问这5种颜色中有几种颜色不含红色阶?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "0",
            "zh": "0"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "1",
            "zh": "1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "2",
            "zh": "2"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "3",
            "zh": "3"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "4",
            "zh": "4"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "D"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **D**.\n\nThe red component of any hexadecimal color is based on the first 2 digits only. For the Olympic Rings 0081C8 (water blue), 008651 (shamrock green), 000000 (black), FCB131 (macaroni and cheese), and EE334E (dark carmine pink), the first 2 digits are 00 for 3 of them: blue, green, and black.",
        "zh": "答案：**D**。\n\n`RRGGBB` 的前两位代表红色。五种颜色的红色值依次是 `00、00、00、FC、EE`。只有蓝色、绿色和黑色三项的红色值为 0。"
      },
